{
  "name": "Onramp Inbound \u2014 Nightly Task Seeding",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "cronExpression": "0 8 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "459a99bd-5587-47a9-9bfe-e8cee71f74dc",
      "name": "Daily 8am",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Edit team_id / title per faculty need. idempotency_key prevents duplicates on retry.\nconst day = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10);\nconst runId = day + '-' + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8);\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    body: {\n      action: 'create_task',\n      team_id: 'team_123',\n      title: 'Starter task for ' + day,\n      description: 'Seeded automatically by the n8n nightly workflow.',\n      priority: 'medium',\n      idempotency_key: 'n8n-nightly-' + runId,\n    }\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "bc9bf204-a861-48e8-91a0-8827c2501e47",
      "name": "Build Task Payload",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// HMAC-SHA256 over the EXACT raw bytes the HTTP node will send.\n// The HTTP node below sends JSON.stringify($json.body) \u2014 keep them in sync.\nconst crypto = require('crypto');\nconst secret = $env.N8N_INBOUND_SECRET || 'REPLACE_WITH_N8N_INBOUND_SECRET';\nconst body = $input.first().json.body;\nconst raw = JSON.stringify(body);\nconst signature = 'sha256=' + crypto.createHmac('sha256', secret).update(raw).digest('hex');\nreturn [{ json: { body, signature } }];"
      },
      "id": "d199a23e-25d0-440a-abd7-27d005668e44",
      "name": "Sign Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        680,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/webhooks/n8n",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-N8N-Signature",
              "value": "={{ $json.signature }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "1e154bba-27a6-4495-8dd4-3ef255f700cf",
      "name": "POST to Onramp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "24385c95-4ab6-495a-b066-476936e7c243",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.success }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "50cd3902-4f37-401c-81a7-1351b9f3bd68",
      "name": "Was It Created?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1120,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "8583420c-ca1d-4f69-8bfe-d3650ff50f90",
      "name": "Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1340,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "2b5720a9-edae-440a-afd6-63bd8e5d8440",
      "name": "Inspect Failure",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1340,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## n8n \u2192 Onramp nightly seeding\\n1. Set env `N8N_INBOUND_SECRET` on BOTH n8n and the Onramp backend (same value).\\n2. Edit `team_id` in Build Task Payload.\\n3. Change the POST URL to your backend (`http://n8n:5678` cannot reach `localhost` from inside Docker \u2014 use `http://host.docker.internal:8000` on Docker Desktop or your backend host).\\n4. Activate, then run once manually and check Onramp Tasks.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "138cf963-46ff-4932-9f68-1601d9fb09a7",
      "name": "Sticky Note - Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        160,
        80
      ]
    }
  ],
